6. AI-generated content
   Much of the code, tests, documentation and benchmark material in this repository was written with the help of large
   language models, mainly Claude (Anthropic) through Claude Code. The external benchmark split in
   docs/benchmarks/external/ was authored by a Gemini model (Google), as docs/benchmarks/external/README.md says. The
   generated utPLSQL tests (tests/generated/), the recorded LLM responses (docs/benchmarks/llm_baseline/) and the benchmark
   templates are model output. All of it is offered under the MIT license of this repository; anyone reusing the generated
   material should check the model providers' terms for the use of outputs.

